{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73341","main_id":73341,"main_title":"甘露之心","main_description":"在花海的深处，有位神秘的花灵正在等着你…","chapter_title":"甘露之心","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7334101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7334101,"sequence":13,"variant":0,"line_id":733410116,"next_line_ids":[733410117],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4443,"speaker_text_hash":1328289424,"speaker":"菲多赫","speaker_raw":"菲多赫","text_hash":3966433218,"text":"只要获得甘露的滋养，无论是怎样的痛苦与悲怨，都会被洗净，最后再度化为纯粹的灵光之属。","raw_text":"只要获得甘露的滋养，无论是怎样的痛苦与悲怨，都会被洗净，最后再度化为纯粹的灵光之属。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7334101.json"}
